    "details": "<p>An elite <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">algorithmic problem-solving CP contest</span>, designed to test analytical limits, data structure mastery, and <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">computational complexity optimization</span> under strict time constraints. Participants tackle multi-tiered problems ranging from <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">dynamic programming to graph theory</span> on standard ICPC scoring.</p>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Participants can be from any recognized university or college.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Participants must connect to the contest server; <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">plagiarism and AI-assisted code generation</span> will lead to immediate disqualification.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Standard ICPC-style rules apply: ranking is determined by <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">total solved problems and penalty time</span>.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Languages permitted: <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">C++, C, Java, and Python 3</span>.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Finalists must carry <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">valid student ID cards</span> for onsite verification.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"space-y-3\">Round 1: Online Preliminary Qualifier\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sand/80 pl-3\">\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">A 1 hour algorithmic coding challenge hosted on the <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">live contest platform</span>.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Top 75 will advance to the <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">on-campus Grand Finale</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"space-y-3\">Round 2: On-Campus Grand Finale\n<ul class=\"space-y-3 font-sans text-sm sm:text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-sand/80 pl-3\">\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">A high-intensity 2<span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">-hour onsite showdown</span> with hidden evaluation test cases.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Scoreboard will be frozen during the <span class=\"text-[#ff453a] font-semibold\">final 60 minutes</span> to heighten suspense.</li>\n<li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">Participants must bring their own laptops</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
